{"lines":[{"t":"Introduction","c":1,"w":0.11536231994628907,"x":0.080178922707447642,"h":0.01508286254846869,"y":0.033156243021453924},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.084362133036144843,"c":1,"y":0.079799764524542627,"t":"MARKING THE PRACTICE TESTS","w":0.43415639241536463},{"y":0.11773255798845605,"x":0.082304530716228425,"t":"Listening and Reading","h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.25102879842122394,"c":1},{"t":"The answer keys are on pages 121-128.","y":0.14098837189938274,"w":0.37448560078938803,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.082304525608392395},{"c":1,"y":0.15786252708941739,"x":0.082237631084375568,"w":0.61946797688802091,"h":0.018901795745598027,"t":"Each question in the Listening and Reading tests is worth one mark."},{"t":"Questions which require letter \/ Roman numeral answers","y":0.19611307446252724,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.084362142308228458,"c":1,"w":0.53909464518229167},{"w":0.82098765055338541,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"For questions where the answers are letters or Roman numerals, you should write only the","x":0.082304528643395922,"y":0.2179034156483145},{"x":0.08230451412054085,"y":0.2354651161190281,"w":0.80452677408854179,"h":0.017479524735988794,"c":1,"t":"number of answers required. For example, if the answer is a single letter or numeral, you"},{"c":1,"x":0.082304525753162633,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.25436046496965237,"t":"should write only one answer. If you have written more letters or numerals than are required,","w":0.83950617472330746},{"x":0.082176352620243878,"w":0.32537045796712238,"y":0.27056093550672056,"t":"the answer must be marked wrong.","h":0.01733062461071222,"c":1},{"t":"Questions which require answers in the form of words or numbers","w":0.62567042032877618,"x":0.084284198674796806,"c":1,"h":0.018716023583294161,"y":0.30751278658499626},{"y":0.33127208484595538,"c":1,"x":0.080246919158164093,"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.46296295166015633,"t":"• Answers may be written in upper or lower case."},{"y":0.348837209155064,"w":0.65226338704427089,"h":0.016003780005537038,"x":0.080246907170348242,"c":1,"t":"• Words in brackets are optional - they are correct, but not necessary."},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"• Alternative answers are separated by a slash (\/).","x":0.080246909374334152,"w":0.47325103759765624,"y":0.3662790696080902},{"t":"• If you are asked to write an answer using a certain number of words and\/or (a) number(s),","x":0.080246920991271231,"y":0.38221436987191737,"w":0.84773661295572911,"h":0.018948420197719473,"c":1},{"t":"you will be penalised if you exceed this. For example, if a question specifies an answer","y":0.40010712056030817,"c":1,"h":0.020211232143802049,"x":0.10896324254503327,"w":0.79030858357747391},{"w":0.79218109130859382,"h":0.017496644818740692,"x":0.11111110064309392,"c":1,"t":"using NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS and the correct answer is 'black leather coat,","y":0.4186046509967748},{"y":0.43635700105231379,"c":1,"h":0.017161651831493208,"x":0.11102563800061413,"w":0.41172325134277343,"t":"the answer 'coat of black leather' is incorrect."},{"x":0.082237910526651775,"w":0.79644388834635405,"c":1,"t":"• In questions where you are expected to complete a gap, you should only transfer the","y":0.45435087481642511,"h":0.019618915023174699},{"w":0.79012344360351561,"y":0.47232037668638016,"c":1,"x":0.1111111177492605,"h":0.017505204860116752,"t":"necessary missing word(s) onto the answer sheet. For example, to complete 'in the...,"},{"w":0.77598312377929679,"x":0.11094734041770589,"h":0.023998420005411858,"c":1,"y":0.48709521273931733,"t":"where the correct answer is 'morning', the answer 'in the morning' would be incorrect."},{"y":0.50872093045067235,"c":1,"h":0.016014051942858987,"t":"• All answers require correct spelling (including words in brackets).","w":0.62139918009440109,"x":0.082304529448684077},{"t":"• Both US and UK spelling are acceptable and are included in the answer key.","y":0.52539154853419023,"w":0.72440602620442707,"x":0.082241494759653047,"h":0.019003469334614609,"c":1},{"y":0.54505300369971843,"t":"• All standard alternatives for numbers, dates and currencies are acceptable.","x":0.08230453643449645,"w":0.71399175008138027,"h":0.015993508068214979,"c":1},{"x":0.082304523513309719,"w":0.4156378682454428,"t":"• All standard abbreviations are acceptable.","c":1,"y":0.56242638379306542,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"w":0.68940800984700523,"t":"• You will find additional notes about individual answers in the answer key.","h":0.017468706317447791,"y":0.57850637282732553,"c":1,"x":0.082260140127406109},{"h":0.020318836710899624,"t":"Writing","c":1,"x":0.085247021234005751,"y":0.60958994888493001,"w":0.082622229258219396},{"h":0.016003780005536927,"t":"The sample answers are on pages 129-138. It is not possible for you to give yourself a mark","w":0.84156377156575524,"y":0.6351590108323234,"c":1,"x":0.084362147116020761},{"y":0.65196867887210519,"w":0.81286895751953137,"t":"for the Writing tasks. We have provided sample answers (written by candidates), showing","x":0.082254845785258698,"h":0.018400851632737192,"c":1},{"y":0.67005813938837211,"t":"their score and the examiners' comments. These sample answers will give you an insight","w":0.81069956461588555,"h":0.016043156420524562,"c":1,"x":0.084362151784956249},{"t":"into what is required for the Writing test.","x":0.082304522505457237,"h":0.015993508068214979,"y":0.68895348818139157,"w":0.36419754028320311,"c":1}],"h":3396,"w":2400}